    "name": "FFPE DNA workflow QC (imported from uploaded file)",
    "readme": " \n# FFPE DNA QC\nThis workflow can assess the extent and types of damage that might be present in a short-read DNA library. It aligns paired-end fastq data to the selected referece genome and produces a QC summary.",
